WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:03,260
Ready? Go!

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:07,560
A. Listen.

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,060
Then point and say

4
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:14,870
1. I'm cold.

5
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:19,160
2. I'm hot.

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:24,240
3. I'm thirsty.

7
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:29,600
4. I'm hungry.

8
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:34,750
Cold. Cold.

9
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:37,250
Hot. Hot.

10
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:40,700
Thirsty. Thirsty.

11
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:45,300
Hungry. Hungry.

12
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:52,880
Cold. Hot. Thirsty.

13
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:56,180
Hungry.

14
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:59,180
B. Listen and chant.

15
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:11,400
Hi, May. Hi, May.

16
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:17,050
How are you? How are you?

17
00:01:17,050 --> 00:01:25,530
I'm cold. I'm cold.

18
00:01:25,530 --> 00:01:30,300
Hi, David. Hi, David.

19
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:34,900
How are you? How are you?

20
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:44,640
I'm hot. I'm hot.

21
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:48,740
Hi, Sally. Hi, Sally.

22
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:53,850
How are you? How are you?

23
00:01:53,850 --> 00:02:00,730
I'm thirsty. I'm thirsty.

24
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:09,920
Hi, Bob. Hi, Bob.

25
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:18,000
How are you? How are you?

26
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,440
I'm hungry. I'm hungry.

27
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:33,260
See. Listen, point and repeat.

28
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:38,350
One. I'm cold.

29
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:42,970
Two. I'm hot.

30
00:02:42,970 --> 00:02:47,720
Three. I'm thirsty.

31
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:50,780
Four. I'm hungry.
